  "description": "GIQPIJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C153 H120 La6 O39,6(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.868-4.502 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.94-130.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C153H120La6O39·6(C7H8). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
